(reentry-simple)
*title Reentry table equivalence case
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*trajectory 1 rv start on 1
  *initial geodetic
    long=0 lat=0 psi=90 time=0 alt=300000 vel=18000 gama=-25 wt=550
  *file reentry.dat
    time alt range vel mach dynprs nx ca
  *segment 1 ballistic
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.1
    *aero ca=(reentry-ca)
    *when alt<0 stop
*end
